# manifest.json is DELIBERATELY NOT EXCLUDED, though the served image never
# reads it. `npm run build` is `tsc -b && vite build`, and `src/manifest.test.ts`
# imports the document by path — so leaving it out of the build context does not
# make a smaller image, it makes `docker build` fail on TS2307 at the last step.
